  "answer_text": "For each hour on December 8, 2025, the camera location with the highest average crowd size was as follows:\n\n- 00:00 - 08:00: 'KeynoteHall_Stage' with average crowds ranging from 6.8 to 7.27.\n- 09:00: 'KeynoteHall_Stage' with an average crowd of 450.19.\n- 10:00 - 11:00: 'ExpoFloor_MainAisle' with average crowds of 179.91 and 179.97.\n- 12:00: 'FoodCourt_North' with an average crowd of 120.05.\n- 13:00: 'ExpoFloor_MainAisle' with an average crowd of 159.95.\n- 14:00: 'KeynoteHall_Stage' with an average crowd of 399.51.\n- 15:00: 'ExpoFloor_MainAisle' with an average crowd of 160.01.\n- 16:00: 'KeynoteHall_Stage' with an average crowd of 379.46.\n- 17:00 - 18:00: 'FoodCourt_North' with average crowds of 100.1 and 99.83.\n- 19:00 - 23:00: 'KeynoteHall_Stage' with average crowds ranging from 6.96 to 7.31.",
